:: bucky [b4 trainer]
<p>"Hey, you!" a friendly voice calls. The trainer is standing near the tree, balancing a stack of apples on their head. "Are you ready to have a contest?"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Ask what kind of contest.->bucky: ask]]</li>
  <li>[[Umm, sure...->bucky: apples]]</li>
  <li>[[Another time: Continue exploring Route 001.->b4]]</li>
</ul>

:: bucky: ask [b4 trainer]
<p>"It's an apple balancing contest, of course! Think you can balance more apples on your head than I can?"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Umm, sure...->bucky: apples]]</li>
  <li>[[Another time: Continue exploring Route 001.->b4]]</li>
</ul>

:: bucky: apples [b4 trainer contest]
<<set $appleNumber1 = random(1, 6), $appleNumber2 = random(1, 6), $appleNumber3 = random(2, 8)>>
<<set $appleAnswer = ($appleNumber1 + $appleNumber2) * $appleNumber3>>
<p>"Listen close, my friend." The trainer points to the apples on their head.</p>
<p>"I have $appleNumber1 apples on my head." Their arms move in a flash as they pick more apples from the tree.</p>
<p>"And then I throw $appleNumber2 more apples up on top, like this!" You can't believe that none of them fall as they throw them up and onto their stack.</p>
<p>"I'll tell you a secret about the apples from this tree...they all have $appleNumber3 worms in them. All of them! It's weird, right? And that's why I don't eat these. Worms are friends."</p>
<p>They continue: "Here is your challenge. How many little friends do I have on my head right now?"</p>
<p><<numberbox "$appleGuess" 0 autofocus>></p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Give your answer.'>>
      <<if $appleAnswer == $appleGuess>>
        <<goto 'bucky: apple result success'>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'bucky: apple result error'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Leave the contest and continue exploring.->bucky: apple result error]]</li>
</ul>

:: bucky: apple result success [b4 trainer contest]
<p>"Correct! You win!" With a shake of their head all the apples come tumbling down.</p>
<p>They catch one in their hand and toss it your way. You put it away and now you have $appleNumber3 little friends in your bag, quietly munching away on the apple.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->b4]]</li>
</ul>

:: bucky: apple result error [b4 trainer contest]
<p>"So close! But not the right answer. Try again."
<p>Hint: The problem is ($appleNumber1 + $appleNumber2) and multiply by $appleNumber3.</p>
<p><<numberbox "$appleGuess" 0 autofocus>></p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Give your answer.'>>
      <<if $appleAnswer == $appleGuess>>
        <<goto 'bucky: apple result success'>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'bucky: apple result error'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Leave the contest and continue exploring.->bucky: apple result error]]</li>
</ul>

